; Expect: FreeTexture: the texture is 0
; A debug build (-d) stops FreeTexture on the 0 of a texture that failed to load. Other builds ignore it.
If GetEnv$("BLITZ_SUITE_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("FreeTexture: the texture is 0 (release build, not checked).")
tex = LoadTexture("does_not_exist.png")
FreeTexture tex
Print "FreeTexture did not stop the program."
